  <desc>Everything about one purchase order, without changing it.</desc>
    <credit type="author">
      <name>Reuben Rissler</name>
      <email>pygtk.posting@gmail.com</email>
    </credit>
  </info>

  <title>PO hub</title>

  <p>The PO hub shows one purchase order from every side, and changes
  nothing. It opens from <link xref="vendor_history"/> and the ledger
  reports.</p>

  <terms>
    <item><title><gui>Metadata</gui></title>
    <p>Its dates, vendor, totals, description and comments, and whether it
    has been posted, received and invoiced. Under <gui>Difference
    between</gui>, choose two of its dates and click <gui>Calculate</gui> to
    see how many days passed between them.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Items</gui></title>
    <p>Every line, including cancelled ones.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Preview</gui></title>
    <p>The order as it was printed.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Attachment</gui></title>
    <p>The scan of the vendor's invoice, if one was attached.</p></item>
  </terms>

</page>
